  "articleBody": "A bedroom addition can provide needed space, but the right plan depends on lot constraints, intended use, structural connections, natural light, emergency escape provisions, heating and cooling, and the rules of the jurisdiction handling the property. A coordinated design-build team can help align layout, permits, selections, construction, and final inspection before work begins.",
